WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:56.690
Someone once said...

00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:00.930
There are bright red berries 
that glisten like jewels

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:04.230
and grow like broccoli,

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:07.100
juicy, sweet-and-sour cherries called...

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:10.700
Broccherries!

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:17.850
There are crunchy, fluffy mushrooms

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:21.050
that look just like popcorn...

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:25.550
Popcorn Mushrooms!

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:32.430
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:38.430
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:44.540
Toriko, Komatsu, and Zebra set 
out for the Gourmet Pyramid

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.870
in order to get Mellow Cola.

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.810
They arrive at the Desert Labyrinth,

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:52.680
also known as the Gourmet Graveyard, 
and suffer from the scorching heat.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:58.380
Suddenly, Komatsu disappears 
into some quicksand.

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:00.890
Zebra emits ultrasonic waves,

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:05.090
then unfurls his Echo Map to track 
down Komatsu in the current of sand.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:10.360
Toriko and Zebra reach Komatsu's location

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:13.230
and gasp at the sight before them...

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:22.170
The Sealed Voice! The 
Other-Dimensional Gourmet Pyramid!

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:31.850
Incredible...

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:36.450
This is... the Gourmet Pyramid?!

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:45.200
It's huge... Looks to be 
about 500 meters tall...

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:49.700
More than that. This is 
just a part of the pyramid.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.000
No more than the tip of the iceberg...

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:54.640
Tip of the iceberg?!

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:03.410
Echolocation! Echo Map!

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.000
What the hell is this?

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.800
Is this thing really a pyramid?

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:28.040
What's with this shape?

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:35.510
Kid! Kid! Kid!

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:40.680
Kid! Kid! Kid!

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:45.920
Kid! Kid! Kid!

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:49.060
Kid!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.730
Where am I...?

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:18.150
Where the heck am I?!

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.220
I remember being carried along by the sand...

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.260
Toriko-san! Zebra-san!

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:05.670
All I'm doing is running away 
from terrifying Beasts...

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.530
But where did the Beasts go...?

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.260
Howl Bullet!

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:39.400
Hey. You wanna die?

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:47.810
What the...?!

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.240
Kid!

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:54.010
Zebra-san...?

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:58.620
Listen up, 'cause I'm 
only gonna say this once.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:03.150
Right now, you're in the basement 
of the Gourmet Pyramid.

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:07.560
We've arrived at the Pyramid, too.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:09.890
This is the inside of the Gourmet Pyramid?!

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.660
Actually, its structure 
is more like a castle,

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.930
but I don't really know anything about it.

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:16.730
Listen, kid.

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:20.040
There are two things you gotta do now.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.070
The first is, try not to die.

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:24.740
Try not to die...?

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:26.140
The other thing...

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:32.850
...is figure out what's gonna be on the menu

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:36.190
at the party after this trip's over.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:38.120
Zebra-san!

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:40.390
Right! I got it!

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:45.190
Thank you, Zebra-san!

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:49.670
While I was being carried 
away by the current of sand,

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:52.770
you kept sending me 
strongly-worded messages...

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:55.600
This is what you get, kid!

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.440
For now, you just gotta hold on. Got me?!

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:03.850
Listen, you better not die on 
me! I'll murder you if you do!

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:10.050
Although they were harsh words, 
and not encouraging at all...

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:11.650
Alright! Alright!

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:15.920
If this is the Gourmet Pyramid, 
then I have to help out some, too!

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:18.260
While taking care not to die,

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:21.700
I have to find out anything 
I can about Mellow Cola!

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:34.380
So Komatsu is already inside the pyramid?!

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:38.850
Let's hurry, Toriko. The 
inside's ridiculously huge.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:42.050
And there are tons of suspiciously 
squirming shadows.

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:44.520
In case there's some dumbass Beast

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.650
that don't get scared away 
by a Howl Bullet I fire off,

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:51.330
I can't guarantee the kid's gonna live.

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:54.800
What happened, Zebra? You're 
being unusually cooperative.

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:58.600
That's 'cause my reward is on the line here.

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:01.500
If the kid dies, I'm up a creek.

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:03.400
Reward?

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:06.840
Never mind. Come on, let's 
get a move on, Toriko.

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.590
The inside is a labyrinth, too?!

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:23.860
Can you use your Echo Map 
to search for a route?

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:26.130
Likely as not, the people that got this far

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:27.960
made a mistake from the very beginning,

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:28.830
and that was

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:33.000
thinkin' this is the entrance to the pyramid.

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:36.840
This is just the peak of the pyramid.

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:37.600
The peak?!

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:38.440
Yeah.

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:43.340
The pyramid proper is buried under the sand,

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:48.150
so we gotta... head... downwards...

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.620
Then Komatsu is below us?!

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:56.350
Zebra?!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:01.490
It's 'cause... I had my map 
wide open all this time...

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:04.660
I lost my voice...

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:14.440
Kid...

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:20.080
I don't know how long I 
can keep this map open...

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:22.810
A pyramid that leads down...

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:25.550
I never heard of anything like that.

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:29.810
Gorgonclops (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 42

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.520
I'm the one that's gonna eat here!

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:55.240
That threat posture... It's 
even stronger than long ago!

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:49.460
I wonder what these markings are...

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:51.220
They keep going on...

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:54.860
Which way should I go?!

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:00.930
Ow...

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:04.840
That's right...

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:09.040
It glowed blue...

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:11.380
What about on that side?

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:17.780
This side reads red...

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:21.950
A dead end...

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.060
Could it mean...

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:27.660
...I should follow where 
the light tells me to go?

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:58.320
Wow...

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:02.730
How big is this place?! I wonder 
how many kilometers long it is.

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:05.160
This is the Gourmet Pyramid...

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:08.060
It really is a mysterious place...

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:09.800
Oh, yeah.

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:12.970
The Gourmet Pyramid is said 
to have been constructed

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:16.370
thousands of years ago,

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:20.510
but it would've been impossible 
for the civilization at the time

00:14:20.510 --> 00:14:22.310
to create it with their technology,

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:24.850
so it's thought something 
beyond that civilization,

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:29.250
something not of this earth, 
had something to do with it.

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:32.920
There's always been a lot 
of speculation about it,

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:37.290
but even now, nobody has gotten to the truth.

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:41.660
According to legends, the king of an 
ancient nation lies sleeping in there

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.830
or there's some legendary 
ingredient hidden in there...

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:49.340
That has to be referring to the Mellow Cola!

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:51.970
And I swear I'll find it!

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:18.870
That was scary...

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:21.940
If you look closely, 
these are unusual stones.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.470
They smell faintly of phosphoric acid...

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.510
And something I've never smelled before.

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:34.010
What is this?!

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:44.820
We're in some crazy place.

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:48.190
What the hell is this room?!

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:02.540
Having you here is a lifesaver, Zebra.

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:05.780
I never would've been able to get through 
this maze without your abilities.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:10.720
Zebra looks really worn out...

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:14.590
He's had his Echo Map open

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:17.420
ever since Komatsu got sucked 
up by that current of sand...

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:21.490
In other words, he's been continuously 
emitting ultrasonic waves.

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:25.000
Normally, if a person sings 
continuously for five minutes,

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:28.030
they'll burn about 10 kilocalories.

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:33.670
In the case of the Echo Map, spread 
out at its limit of 70 kilometers,

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:37.310
60,000 kilocalories of energy are 
needed in a five-minute period.

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:41.910
He's had the map activated 
for five hours already,

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:45.480
so he's burned 3,600,000 kilocalories!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.920
Taking a normal human like 
Komatsu as a comparison,

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:53.220
it would be like using up 
four years' worth of energy.

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:59.530
Even Zebra, who boasts an overwhelming 
amount of stamina and a cast iron throat,

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:03.800
is overtaxing his voice as 
he tries to keep the map up.

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:20.480
Zebra!

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:33.900
Unicorn Cerberus (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 63

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:37.870
I'll take care of this one!

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:45.010
This guy's dangerous!

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.240
Fork Shield!

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:55.950
15-fold Spiked Punch!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.330
Leg Fork!

00:18:13.430 --> 00:18:13.970
Oh, no!

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:24.680
Zebra! In your condition, you...

00:18:25.610 --> 00:18:29.080
It's not like I did it to help you...

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.750
I've got a way...

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:36.090
...to quickly produce energy.

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:41.260
I just gotta get mad!

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:47.430
Zebra, you've already used up your voice...

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:54.140
Take this!

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:17.400
I gave...

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:20.000
...the rest of my voice...

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:22.600
...to the kid.

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:23.940
What do you mean?

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:28.070
Has your voice given out completely?!

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:37.320
"The map got shut off...

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:40.150
I lost track of the kid"?!

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:00.970
These footprints...

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:12.170
Dishing with Tina!

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:14.840
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:18.480
Our guest today is Gourmet 
Knight, Takimaru-san!

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:19.650
Hello.

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:26.590
Um... What's wrong?

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:28.520
This is the first time since 
starting "Dishing with Tina"

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:32.890
that I've had a wonderful, <i>normal</i> guest!

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:36.360
At last, I can have a heaping 
helping of talk on this talk show!

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.170
It's a pleasure to be here.

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:41.940
Today, let's start by taking 
a look at a delicious meal

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:43.900
based on the principles 
of the Gourmet Knights.

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:48.580
We'll present these dishes in the order 
that Takimaru-san recommends them.

00:21:49.480 --> 00:21:52.880
This will give us insight 
into Takimaru-san's taste.

00:21:54.350 --> 00:21:56.180
I wonder what's inside!

00:21:56.650 --> 00:21:57.980
Let's start with number three!

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:00.250
Ta-daaa!

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:02.920
So... what's this?

00:22:03.720 --> 00:22:05.490
These are Horsetail Beans.

00:22:09.960 --> 00:22:12.630
The more you chew them, the more 
the simple, earthy aroma comes out.

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:15.000
Go ahead, Tina-san.

00:22:16.870 --> 00:22:19.610
I asked you about your ranked <i>meal</i> dishes...

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:23.210
Let's get back on track! Number two!

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:25.880
Ta-daaa!

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:27.510
Beans?

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:30.180
These are Pebble Beans.

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:36.660
When you eat them, your jaw 
will naturally become stronger.

00:22:37.590 --> 00:22:38.390
Here, Tina-san, have one.

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:41.190
I don't believe this!

00:22:42.530 --> 00:22:46.930
And finally, let's unveil our 
surprising, ultra-epicurean dish!

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:49.730
Ta... daaa!!

00:22:52.400 --> 00:22:55.410
More beans?!

00:22:55.740 --> 00:22:58.580
These are my best three dishes.

00:22:59.710 --> 00:23:01.010
Please try them yourself at home.

00:23:01.680 --> 00:23:04.420
Let's... move on to the next segment...

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.790
A mysterious shadow closes in on Komatsu.

00:23:09.090 --> 00:23:10.520
Who or what is it?

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:12.660
Toriko, Zebra, hurry!

00:23:13.070 --> 00:23:16.730
Astounding! The Mysterious Ancient Manuscript and the Creature Inside the Coffin!

00:23:17.060 --> 00:23:18.830
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
